    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p>You have been trained in the use of phasic rounds. Using two actions, you can modify your ammunition to gain the following features:</p><p>Rounds coated in a mass effect field that phases through all defensive layers. Phasic rounds bypass kinetic shields, biotic barriers, and Combat Armor Frames entirely — damage is dealt directly to HP. However, the phasing effect reduces total damage dealt to <strong>40%</strong>.</p><p>Remove this effect to return to standard ammunition.</p>"
